     1629     if error-status:error then return no-apply.
     1630   END.
     1631   ON RETURN OF sch-cli-code IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     1632   DO:
     1633     run proc-find-obj-code in this-procedure(no, input frame Dialog-Frame sch-cli-code) no-error.
     1634     if error-status:error then return no-apply.
     1635   END.
     1636   ON CTRL-J OF sch-corr-date IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
